--- .gitignore (原始)


+++ .gitignore (修改后)
```
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
env/
venv/
.venv/
.ENV
.ENV.local

# Build and distribution artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# IDE and editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp

# Logs
*.log

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Coverage reports
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage/

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```